<title>PHILIPPINES: RCBC 9-mth net up at 1.009 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>RCBC 9-mth net up at 1.009 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating Income (billion)   5.927 vs 4.632</p>
<p>    Net income			 1,009 vs 706.932</p>
<p>Note: Full name Rizal Commercial Banking Corp. The bank said its higher income was due to modest growth in its loans and deposit portfolio. The figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
